==Strategy==
This stage revolves around the extremely buffed Lione Hippoes protecting the Dark Emperor Santas and Lucky Sloths. One thing to look out for is the Hackey, because it's so buffed that it can two shot your base meaning you will die unless you knock it back.

You need [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[Long Distance|LD]] units because of the amount of backliners. Some good options are [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] or [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]. Make sure not to bring anything that pushes too hard, or Santa will destroy you.

[[Cat God the Great (Special Cat)]] can also be a solid choice here due to his omnistrike and kb capabilities, make sure you time him right though.

Most of the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] exclusives are good here along with any other LD Uber you have, like [[Splendid Ganesha (Uber Rare Cat)|Ganesha]] or [[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Mami Tomoe]].

